238
00:17:52,614 --> 00:17:54,990
Quer dizer Salem's Lot.

239
00:17:54,991 --> 00:17:59,286
Nunca vá para Salem's Lot.

240
00:17:59,287 --> 00:18:01,997
Salem's Lot, um lugar maligno.

241
00:18:01,998 --> 00:18:03,582
Cale a boca, Sherry, cara,
você está tornando tudo pior.

